&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:16px"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:aptos,aptos_embeddedfont,aptos_msfontservice,sans-serif"&gt;A strong advocate for rural hospitals, Jeremy Davis, who is the president and CEO of Grand Ronde Hospital, was elected to serve as Chair-Elect and Chair the Public Policy Committee.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

