&lt;p style="margin-left:9.0pt"&gt;Vancouver, Wash. &ndash; Clark County Community Services is asking residents who are living on a limited income to complete a survey about their family&rsquo;s needs. This confidential survey is available in English, Spanish, Russian, Ukrainian, and Chuukese and will take about 15 minutes to complete.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="margin-left:9.0pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style="margin-left:9.0pt"&gt;The survey will be available now through March 31.&lt;/p&gt;

