&lt;p&gt;Community Services is required to conduct a Community Needs Assessment every three years. The results will help Clark County and the Community Action Advisory Board prioritize funding for anti-poverty services. Beyond county funding and policy, this assessment provides information on the landscape of poverty in Clark County and is shared publicly and used broadly by local organizations in their program development and grant application processes.&lt;/p&gt;

