&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;January 15, 2026 &ndash; Newport, OR&lt;br /&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The Lincoln County Sheriff&rsquo;s Office is aware of a helicopter crash near Milepost 3 on Moonshine Park Rd (east Lincoln County). Our team and partnering agencies are currently on-site. The scene is contained and there appears to be no danger to the community. Community members are asked to stay clear of the area while responders&amp;nbsp; assess the situation.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;More information will be shared as the situation develops.&lt;br /&gt;
&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;

